# The catalog is signed byte for byte: index.json lists the SHA-256 of every
# recipe file, and the signature covers index.json. Git for Windows converts
# line endings on checkout by default, which turns every LF into CRLF - and
# then no checksum matches and the launcher, rightly, loads no recipe at all.
# Found by cloning into an empty folder, which is what CI does.
catalog/** -text
